      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Row-Haan and this video is about how an AI voice reads a script, including the one reading this to you. It doesn't read letters the way you do. First it turns the words into sounds, and that step is where most of its mistakes happen.",
