    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "NUMBERS",
      "narration_text": "The clean-up step does better. Doctor, street, one thousand twenty-four, the fifth of May: all right. But a price trips it up. It costs three dollars fifty comes out as dollar, three, fifty. Listen.",
