    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "THE FIX",
      "narration_text": "The fix is to spell a word the way it sounds. This voice got my name wrong, so every script spells it Row dash Haan. It read the drum, the dhole, as dee haal, and the sitaar as sitter, until I respelled them. Here's my name as the pronunciation step reads it, then respelled.",
